<title>BELGIUM: EU to vet UPM-Kymmene /Finnpap deal.</title>
<headline>EU to vet UPM-Kymmene /Finnpap deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had started a routine review of a deal under which Finnish forestry giant UPM-Kymmene takes control of sales and marketing firm Finnpap Ltd.</p>
<p>Finnpap is a marketing association run by Finnish paper producers. The sale of Finnpap's marketing network to UPM-Kymmene was announced in January 1996.</p>
<p>The Commission has one month to complete its investigation and either clear the deal or start a detailed four-month inquiry. Most deals are approved after one month.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 287 68 11</p>
</text>
